.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Understand this ability’s expectations — description and milestone ladder — and how it connects to assignments, positions, and people, so coaching and calibration stay grounded in a shared source of truth.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render "shared/maap/definition"
  %p.mb-3
    Abilities are the skill ladder behind assignments. Fresh milestone prose keeps MAAP trustworthy. Anyone can propose edits; only people with update permission publish them.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li Essentials (department, description, milestones) sit outside cards for easy reading.
    %li
      %strong Connected
      shows where this ability is required and who has earned milestones.
    %li
      %strong Continuously more clear
      covers maintainers, proposed edits, and anonymous first-rating alignment between employees and managers.
